# Git Workflow

## Branching model

- main: production-ready, duoc bao ve, chi merge qua PR.
- dev: integration branch, base cho moi branch moi.
- feature/short-desc: vd: feature/order-module.
- fix/short-desc: vd: fix/auth-401-loop.
- hotfix/short-desc: khap cap, branch tu main, merge ca main + dev.
- refactor/short-desc: vd: refactor/extract-flashsale-order-port.
- chore/short-desc: vd: chore/init-project-structure.
- docs/short-desc: vd: docs/sync-api-document.md.

### Khi nao dung hotfix/ thay cho fix/

- fix/x: bug thuong, lam trong sprint, branch tu dev, merge vao dev.
- hotfix/x: bug khap cap tren production, branch tu main, merge thang vao main roi cherry-pick / merge nguoc ve dev.

## Quy trinh BAT BUOC truoc moi task

1. git checkout dev
2. git pull origin dev
3. git checkout -b type/shorter-desc
4. lam task
5. git add .
6. git commit --trailer "Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>" -m type:mo ta ngan
7. DUNG - KHONG push.

## Commit message

Ngan gon, dung thay doi, conventional commit (tieng Anh):

- feat: implement flash sale reservation
- fix: restore exact reserved stock on timeout
- chore: initialize project structure
- docs: update API endpoint for image module
- refactor: extract FlashSaleOrderPort interface
- hotfix: patch payment callback signature mismatch

- 1 commit = 1 concern.
- Body giai thich tai sao, khong lap lai cai gi.

## Quy tac commit & add

- Dung git add . de dua toan bo file vao staging, sau do commit.
- KHONG can (va khong khuyen khich) git add tung file thu cong.
- Commit CHI nhung gi da thuc su thay doi trong task hien tai.

## KHONG push

- Agent TUYET DOI KHONG chay git push duoi moi hinh thuc.
- Push len GitHub la cua nguoi dung.
- Sau khi commit xong bao cao cho user, user tu quyet dinh push.

## Conflict resolution

1. Agent chay git status de liet ke file bi conflict.
2. Agent KHONG tu y resolve bang git checkout --theirs/--ours / git add / sua noi dung.
3. Agent doc tung file conflict, tom tat cho user.
4. Agent dung AskQuestion de user chon huong xu ly.
5. Sau khi user duyet, agent moi sua file + git add . + commit.

## Khong commit

- .env, application-local.yaml (chi commit .example), secret, password, API key
- IDE files khong can thiet
- build output (build/, target/)

## PR

- 1 PR = 1 concern.
- Mo ta ngan gon: thay doi gi, tai sao, anh huong gi.
- Neu co migration: ghi ro version + anh huong rollback.
- Neu co breaking change API: ghi ro trong PR body.